Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 15:07:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(trading): honour the Trade confirmation setting with
 a confirmation sheet before real-money orders

User.tradeConfirmation was stored and toggleable in Settings but never read. When it is on, BUY/SELL now opens TradeConfirmSheet (side, stake, balance after; Enter/Escape; nothing debited until confirmed). Free Tap is unaffected.
